OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FMost places
OL,6,Fwill be dry with clear spells this
OL,7,Fevening and overnight, though a few
OL,8,Fshowers are possible at first, mainly
OL,9,Facross Angus. Turning rather cold with
OL,10,Flight winds and some frost developing
OL,11,Fin prone spots.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSaturday:FA cold, clear start with
OL,14,Ffrost in places. Then remaining dry
OL,15,Fand settled through the day with
OL,16,Fplenty of sunshine and just a few
OL,17,Fpatches of cloud in the afternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
