OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FDry and
OL,6,Fsettled on Sunday with sunshine.
OL,7,FPartly cloudy on Monday with some
OL,8,Fsunny spells at first, before turning
OL,9,Fmore widely cloudy on Tuesday with the
OL,10,Frisk of patchy rain.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
